PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  GRID_COLS.lg = 4               → MiniGridLayout.columns = 4
  maxY … : 2 / safeMaxY guard    → MiniGridProjection: rows = max(y+heightUnits) (or 2 when empty / non-positive);
                                   integer grid units are always finite, so the web `Number.isFinite` guard
                                   reduces to `maxY > 0`. EXECUTED-green (empty ⇒ 2, zero-span ⇒ 2, max ⇒ rows).
  aspectRatio cols/safeMaxY      → .aspectRatio(columns/rows, contentMode: .fit) on the GeometryReader
  left/top/width/height %        → MiniGridTile fractional rect (x/cols, y/rows, w/cols, h/rows) × proxy.size;
                                   .offset + .frame inside a topLeading ZStack (absolute positioning parity)
  bg-white/[0.02] + border       → Color.TS.surfaceGlass fill + Color.TS.border stroke, clipped to rounded-lg
  tile bg-white/[0.06] + border  → Color.TS.textPrimary.opacity(0.06) + Color.TS.border (theme-aware, light+dark)
  rounded-lg / rounded-sm        → TSRadius.sm container · 3 pt tile (web rounded-sm has no semantic token)
  padding: 2px (icon inset)      → MiniGridPreviewMetrics.iconInset = 2
  getWidgetDef(widgetId)?.icon   → MiniGridIconResolving.systemImage(forWidgetID:) → SF Symbol; default catalog
                                   covers all 118 registry ids; unknown ⇒ nil (web miss). lucide glyph → SF Symbol.
  h-3 w-3 text-muted             → Image(systemName:) scaled to min(side)·0.5 (clamped 6…16), Color.TS.textMuted
  empty layout (bare box)        → friendly empty state: faint grid glyph + muted caption (prompt's empty-state
                                   mandate — "never a blank box"); the only deliberate enrichment over the source.
  i18n                           : the web surface is anonymous (no t() calls). The preview's OWN chrome (empty
                                   caption + VoiceOver summary) lives in the P1/S10 table "MiniGridPreview"; the
                                   dashboard's name/widgets are caller-supplied (web takes them as a prop). Zero
                                   English literals in code.
  a11y                           : the thumbnail is non-interactive → a single combined element
                                   (.accessibilityElement(children: .ignore)) labelled "Dashboard layout preview,
                                   N widgets" with distinct empty / singular / plural phrasing (never "1 widgets");
                                   tiles + glyphs are decorative (.accessibilityHidden). Dynamic Type via system
                                   fonts; no motion (reduce-motion safe by construction).
  telemetry                      : view.opened surface="MiniGridPreview" via MiniGridPreviewSurface.reportOpen
                                   (P1/S11), default OSLog sink (slug only, redaction-safe).

